*Additional Context from Global Summary:**\n- Staff wearing gloves and safety vests → consistent with fast-food hygiene standards.  \n- Commercial kitchen with stainless steel equipment → matches McDonald’s or similar chain.  \n- Focus on efficiency and assembly → aligns with burger chain operations.  \n\n---\n\n### ✅ **Conclusion:**\nAll criteria are satisfied. The video explicitly shows **hamburger preparation** using **griddles** and **no equipment or ingredients** related to steaks, candy, or ice cream. The temporal sequence confirms the full process from cooking to assembly.\n\n**Answer \'2\' (Hamburg making) is correct.**'}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0498.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0499.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0500.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0623.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0624.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0625.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0626.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0627.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0628.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0629.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0630.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0631.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0632.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_0633.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_1157.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_1158.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/O14bbpvy2x0/frames/frame_1159.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/l